  "description": "CropGuardian is a comprehensive .NET class library for agricultural management systems. It provides essential features for farm operations, including field management, crop monitoring, weather integration, IoT device support, soil nutrient analysis, and task scheduling. Built with modern .NET practices, it offers secure, scalable, and extensible components for building agricultural software solutions.\n\n      Key Features:\n      - Farm and field management\n      - Crop lifecycle tracking\n      - Weather monitoring and forecasting\n      - IoT device integration\n      - Soil nutrient analysis\n      - Task scheduling\n      - Built-in security\n\n      Target Framework: .NET 9.0",
